Subject: [PATCH 3/7] S3-7: the PS1 keeps the old vignette code (its overlay
 does not grow), docs, speed status

cutscene.c: the four vignettes' draw functions have the pre-S3-7 text for the PS1 and the kept
version elsewhere (the PS1 object is the base's, 27,542 B on the host, byte for byte the size);
puff_cloud / erupt_cloud are out of line. Docs: docs/GBA.md Speed wave 3: S3-7 and ledger row 59,
ROADMAP.md, status/SPEED.md (SPEED-2).

