 - **LV1, map format v2 and levelcheck (2026-11-13, LEVELS round 1; `core/data/maps/README.md` "Format v2", docs/LEVELS.md):** `tools/mapc.py` learns `format 2`, header keys (`fog view gravity dark note gba detail hero`), `zone`, `path`, `swap` blocks, `texbank` and `tflags2`, and refuses what the plan lists; a v2 map gets a ROM `DoomoMapExt` (map.h), accessors in `core/src/levels_mapx.c`. The 12 existing maps are v1 and byte-identical (`check-gen`). New `tools/levelcheck.py` + `core/tools/map_bfs.h` / `mapreach.c` (the one reachability search `test_maps` also runs: walk, zip, arc, tube, ride, raft, bounce, gravity, swap sets by trigger / kill event / lever, hooks, soft locks) with one test map per edge kind; `make -C core test` now also runs `mapc-check` (75 + 9 Python tests) and `levelcheck`. No resident byte on any platform; the script VM (`on EVENT do ACTION`) is LV2.
