+
+Every window above but card 4 has `expect-fps 29`. Single 50 ms frames remain at the first tick of a shot (the caption text window is raised and
+laid out, a stamp or picture is asked for the first time); the fog's work maximum is 33-35 ms but no two frames in a row run over.
+
+**Costs.** ROM +4.24 MB: `backdrops.bin` 3,659,772 -> 7,897,220 B (family 4, 99 pictures, 1.98 MB: the 82 cloud pictures 1.57 MB, 10 Vapula
